WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:31.129
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:31.399 --> 00:33.359
If you had brought out that money

3
00:33.920 --> 00:35.280
and laid it out in front of everyone,

4
00:35.840 --> 00:37.640
telling them what happened that night,

5
00:37.640 --> 00:39.399
would anyone still refuse to believe it?

6
00:42.119 --> 00:44.880
If Liu Tieping had known the truth,

7
00:46.000 --> 00:48.560
would he have done something so stupid?

8
00:50.039 --> 00:51.920
If Qian Yichuan had known the truth,

9
00:51.920 --> 00:53.679
would he have hurled insults at

10
00:54.039 --> 00:56.159
such a kindhearted woman?

11
00:58.880 --> 01:00.439
Every holiday,

12
01:01.479 --> 01:02.640
you throw money around,

13
01:02.840 --> 01:04.359
visiting the weak and the sick.

14
01:07.200 --> 01:08.799
But have you ever told them

15
01:08.799 --> 01:10.159
that this money was won

16
01:10.159 --> 01:11.799
by Liu Xuemei for them?

17
01:11.799 --> 01:14.079
That she drank for it, cup after cup?

18
01:17.000 --> 01:19.599
If she hadn't been forced to drink,

19
01:22.319 --> 01:23.760
she wouldn't have frozen to death.

20
01:25.519 --> 01:27.319
If she'd known you were like this,

21
01:28.519 --> 01:30.480
she would've rather gone to Cheng Youtian

22
01:30.480 --> 01:32.000
and wouldn't have frozen to death.

23
01:38.879 --> 01:41.719
Liu Tieping killing someone was indeed a crime.

24
01:43.680 --> 01:44.760
And what about you?

25
01:46.439 --> 01:48.319
Isn't what you did a crime too?

26
01:51.040 --> 01:52.239
Everyone says

27
01:53.680 --> 01:54.760
you're a good person.

28
01:56.319 --> 01:57.359
But in reality?

29
01:58.719 --> 02:00.400
Have you ever searched your conscience?

30
02:01.959 --> 02:04.439
How can you face a soul misunderstood,

31
02:04.599 --> 02:05.719
slandered,

32
02:06.280 --> 02:08.520
and stripped of dignity?

33
02:09.280 --> 02:11.800
How can you face your own soul?

34
02:14.919 --> 02:18.680
Did you deserve Liu Xuemei's trust?

35
02:29.159 --> 02:30.719
Are you even human?

36
02:36.039 --> 02:38.039
Are you even human?

37
02:58.800 --> 03:00.240
Poor Sister Xuemei.

38
03:02.800 --> 03:03.639
I heard

39
03:04.080 --> 03:05.479
her kid is still pretty young.

40
03:13.919 --> 03:14.680
Yeah.

41
03:19.680 --> 03:20.400
When the time comes,

42
03:21.280 --> 03:22.680
around the holidays and such,

43
03:23.240 --> 03:24.159
we should go visit him,

44
03:25.759 --> 03:27.439
see if he's having any trouble,

45
03:27.439 --> 03:28.639
and help out however we can.

46
03:40.719 --> 03:41.560
Where's the money?

47
03:54.639 --> 03:55.159
I spent it.

48
04:03.719 --> 04:04.360
Actually,

49
04:07.680 --> 04:09.800
every year during the holidays,

50
04:12.919 --> 04:14.840
and for fellow workers' major life events,

51
04:15.879 --> 04:17.120
I gave plenty of gift money.

52
04:19.759 --> 04:20.560
Including for your mom.

53
04:36.079 --> 04:37.120
Let's not talk about this anymore.

54
04:42.240 --> 04:43.639
Tomorrow, I'll turn myself in to the police.

55
04:45.519 --> 04:46.600
Whether they lock me up or fine me,

56
04:47.720 --> 04:48.319
I'll take it all.

57
04:50.160 --> 04:51.040
Hold on.

58
04:52.560 --> 04:53.399
Explain yourself.

59
04:54.079 --> 04:55.120
What happened to my mom?

60
04:57.439 --> 04:57.959
It's nothing.

61
04:58.639 --> 04:59.319
Explain yourself.

62
04:59.319 --> 05:00.279
What happened to my mom?

63
05:06.199 --> 05:07.120
Back in 2003,

64
05:09.240 --> 05:11.959
didn't your mom get surgery for a pacemaker?

65
05:14.600 --> 05:15.959
You were busy in Beijing back then,

66
05:16.079 --> 05:16.680
couldn't make it back.

67
05:18.560 --> 05:19.519
I paid for it.

68
05:19.519 --> 05:20.040
No...

69
05:21.839 --> 05:22.959
What was actually used was

70
05:23.439 --> 05:24.199
Liu Xuemei's money.

71
05:33.480 --> 05:34.439
Is there anything else?

72
05:47.480 --> 05:48.319
In Beijing,

73
05:50.879 --> 05:52.040
your tuition,

74
05:52.560 --> 05:53.360
living expenses,

75
05:54.879 --> 05:55.879
and rent—

76
06:01.879 --> 06:02.639
it all came from Xuemei.

77
06:41.279 --> 06:42.920
Back then, you never even asked me

78
06:44.279 --> 06:46.240
where a laid-off worker like me got so much money.

79
06:47.360 --> 06:48.360
I told you back then

80
06:48.360 --> 06:50.079
I earned it from the bridal shop,

81
06:50.560 --> 06:51.920
that I was sharper than everyone else,

82
06:51.920 --> 06:53.199
and you just bought it.

83
06:59.000 --> 06:59.480
Right.

84
07:01.000 --> 07:02.360
The startup funds for that bridal shop...

85
07:02.360 --> 07:03.199
came from Liu Xuemei.

86
07:03.199 --> 07:03.959
But the point is,

87
07:04.560 --> 07:06.279
do you know, opening that shop,

88
07:06.279 --> 07:07.399
how much effort I put in?

89
07:08.920 --> 07:10.079
I worked from dawn till dusk.

90
07:10.120 --> 07:11.199
Dirty work, hard labor,

91
07:11.199 --> 07:12.240
I did all of it.

92
07:12.240 --> 07:13.240
And why?

93
07:14.160 --> 07:16.720
Just so you could live a good life in Beijing!

94
07:29.120 --> 07:30.160
I really didn't want to

95
07:30.639 --> 07:31.399
tell you any of this.

96
07:31.399 --> 07:31.879
Really.

97
07:31.879 --> 07:33.240
I'd rather die than

98
07:33.279 --> 07:34.680
tell you about this.

99
07:35.680 --> 07:37.160
Because I didn't want you to end up like me,

100
07:37.199 --> 07:38.319
carrying this burden of guilt.

101
07:41.439 --> 07:43.879
Just one wrong move,

102
07:46.959 --> 07:48.360
and there was no turning back.

103
07:50.639 --> 07:52.240
It's been sheer agony.

104
07:57.519 --> 07:58.439
You know,

105
07:59.120 --> 08:01.040
ever since I touched that money

106
08:01.439 --> 08:03.040
and didn't turn it in,

107
08:03.040 --> 08:05.000
I haven't been able to sleep.

108
08:06.879 --> 08:08.800
I keep having nightmares!

109
08:14.879 --> 08:16.199
I'd much rather

110
08:17.439 --> 08:18.959
have nothing to my name,

111
08:18.959 --> 08:20.439
be dirt poor,

112
08:20.800 --> 08:22.199
than have touched that money.

113
08:22.199 --> 08:23.399
I never should've touched it.

114
08:27.720 --> 08:28.839
There's no going back.

115
08:31.000 --> 08:32.320
There's no going back now...

116
08:46.919 --> 08:48.080
So Leshui, you see,

117
08:49.639 --> 08:50.200
that's just how it is.

118
08:51.440 --> 08:51.960
I

119
08:53.399 --> 08:54.120
might seem,

120
08:54.720 --> 08:55.279
right?

121
08:55.960 --> 08:56.840
like a pretty decent guy.

122
08:58.279 --> 08:59.799
But do you have any idea

123
08:59.799 --> 09:01.399
what kind of filth I hide inside?

124
09:03.080 --> 09:04.360
And you're no different.

125
09:07.159 --> 09:08.120
Without even realizing it,

126
09:08.799 --> 09:11.320
you've been tainted by all that filth too.

127
09:11.320 --> 09:12.519
You don't even realize it yourself, do you?

128
09:13.639 --> 09:14.799
That's just the way the world is.

129
09:17.480 --> 09:18.639
Hardly anyone is purely good.

130
09:20.360 --> 09:22.080
Neither you nor I could withstand judgment.

131
09:23.320 --> 09:24.320
Judgment of the law,

132
09:25.080 --> 09:26.039
judgment of morality,

133
09:26.639 --> 09:27.639
judgment of conscience.

134
09:33.480 --> 09:36.200
Only when we face judgment

135
09:39.799 --> 09:41.960
can we truly see the evil within ourselves.

136
09:54.840 --> 09:55.919
Tomorrow I'll go to the police station.

137
09:58.000 --> 09:58.759
I'll confess to everything.

138
13:12.519 --> 13:13.080
Sister Xuemei,

139
13:15.879 --> 13:16.440
wake up.

140
13:22.440 --> 13:23.320
Haipeng.

141
13:25.200 --> 13:25.720
Take this.

142
13:29.120 --> 13:29.639
Let's go!

143
13:29.639 --> 13:30.360
Let's go hand out the money!

144
13:32.080 --> 13:32.440
Let's go.

145
13:32.440 --> 13:32.840
Move it.

146
13:42.759 --> 13:43.320
Come on!

147
13:45.440 --> 13:45.879
Where is everyone?

148
13:46.519 --> 13:47.559
Sister Xuemei, come on.

149
13:47.799 --> 13:48.440
Where's everybody?

150
13:50.639 --> 13:52.639
Where is everyone? Come on out!

151
13:53.840 --> 13:55.360
Sister Xuemei is back!

152
13:55.360 --> 13:56.720
Xuemei's back!

153
13:56.720 --> 13:57.320
Holy cow!

154
13:57.360 --> 13:58.279
Xuemei!

155
13:58.320 --> 13:58.879
You're back!

156
13:58.879 --> 13:59.679
Hurry over here!

157
14:02.399 --> 14:04.519
Sister Xuemei is handing out money!

158
14:11.840 --> 14:12.600
Don't push! Stop shoving!

159
14:12.600 --> 14:13.120
Here.

160
14:13.559 --> 14:14.080
Holy smokes!

161
14:14.320 --> 14:14.960
There's so much! Here.

162
14:15.960 --> 14:16.519
This is yours.

163
14:18.159 --> 14:18.799
This is yours.

164
14:19.200 --> 14:19.720
Here you go.

165
14:19.919 --> 14:20.440
Wonderful!

166
14:21.559 --> 14:22.159
This is great!

167
14:22.279 --> 14:22.879
Awesome!

168
14:25.799 --> 14:26.399
Fantastic!

169
14:26.519 --> 14:27.159
This is amazing!

170
14:31.840 --> 14:32.519
Great!

171
14:34.279 --> 14:35.240
Mine too! Don't forget me!

172
14:38.360 --> 14:39.240
This is mine!

173
14:40.159 --> 14:41.000
There's so much!

174
16:26.639 --> 16:27.039
Over there.

175
16:28.240 --> 16:28.799
Let's go check it out.

176
17:12.440 --> 17:13.039
Xiaosheng,

177
17:14.119 --> 17:15.799
This is the first time I've ever written a letter,

178
17:16.680 --> 17:17.799
and it'll be my last.

179
17:19.039 --> 17:20.920
My life is coming to an end.

180
17:22.000 --> 17:24.119
I used to think I did the right thing

181
17:24.519 --> 17:25.480
using the wrong methods,

182
17:26.759 --> 17:27.839
but the truth is, I was just wrong.

183
17:28.799 --> 17:30.200
If I had known that sooner,

184
17:30.920 --> 17:32.440
maybe I would've made the right choices.

185
17:33.799 --> 17:34.880
I remember you telling me

186
17:35.759 --> 17:37.519
that Chen Yuan said your mother's bottle cap

187
17:37.640 --> 17:38.400
would be one of a kind.

188
17:39.559 --> 17:40.759
So I'm giving it to you

189
17:41.519 --> 17:42.279
as a keepsake.

190
17:43.880 --> 17:44.359
And another thing...

191
17:45.400 --> 17:46.319
I brought ruin upon my mentor.

192
17:47.200 --> 17:49.200
One day, when he's released from prison,

193
17:50.160 --> 17:51.039
I hope you can go pick him up.

194
17:52.559 --> 17:53.440
If possible,

195
17:53.799 --> 17:54.839
please look after him for me.

196
17:56.640 --> 17:57.200
Xiaosheng,

197
17:58.559 --> 17:59.559
everything I did

198
17:59.720 --> 18:00.480
was utterly foolish.

199
18:01.519 --> 18:02.440
It destroyed me,

200
18:03.079 --> 18:04.039
ruined my mentor,

201
18:05.079 --> 18:06.160
and hurt so many people.

202
18:07.599 --> 18:09.759
But if it clears your mother's name,

203
18:10.480 --> 18:11.240
then it was worth it.

204
18:13.440 --> 18:14.519
Right now, I want to tell you:

205
18:15.200 --> 18:17.680
Even though this world is full of evil and injustice,

206
18:18.359 --> 18:19.720
we can't become criminals.

207
18:20.319 --> 18:21.720
You must be a good person,

208
18:22.440 --> 18:23.559
just like your mother was.

209
18:24.079 --> 18:24.839
Kind,

210
18:25.240 --> 18:25.920
upright,

211
18:26.240 --> 18:26.799
forbearing,

212
18:27.279 --> 18:27.839
and compassionate.

213
18:28.720 --> 18:29.400
It's not easy.

214
18:30.839 --> 18:31.759
None of us could manage it.

215
18:32.519 --> 18:33.279
Now it's up to you.

216
18:34.559 --> 18:34.960
Wishing you

217
18:35.799 --> 18:36.680
all the best,

218
18:37.240 --> 18:37.880
Liu Tieping

219
19:03.839 --> 19:04.880
The house is sold.

220
19:07.960 --> 19:08.799
When are you moving?

221
19:09.640 --> 19:10.400
As soon as I can.

222
19:11.759 --> 19:13.079
So you won't get annoyed seeing me.

223
19:13.839 --> 19:14.440
First thing in the morning,

224
19:14.440 --> 19:15.680
what did I do to tick you off?

225
19:16.240 --> 19:17.359
No, no, nothing like that.

226
19:18.799 --> 19:19.599
It's just...

227
19:21.039 --> 19:22.039
I just feel a bit...

228
19:25.480 --> 19:27.200
Don't tell me you're gonna miss me.

229
19:29.960 --> 19:30.599
Hold on a sec.

230
19:31.400 --> 19:31.960
What is it?

231
19:40.880 --> 19:41.480
What's this?

232
19:43.119 --> 19:44.400
I pulled this from The Malt Kingdom,

233
19:44.400 --> 19:45.599
picked it out frame by frame.

234
19:46.720 --> 19:47.759
Since you're leaving,

235
19:48.559 --> 19:49.240
keep it as a keepsake.

236
20:14.519 --> 20:15.279
What a beauty.

237
20:15.400 --> 20:16.079
Who's that?

238
20:16.720 --> 20:18.200
Smiling so happily.

239
20:30.400 --> 20:31.680
This is the best photo

240
20:32.480 --> 20:34.039
taken of me in my whole life.

241
20:35.640 --> 20:36.400
Thank you.

242
20:46.559 --> 20:47.039
By the way,

243
20:47.240 --> 20:48.480
there's something

244
20:48.759 --> 20:50.240
I've been too embarrassed to tell you.

245
20:51.319 --> 20:53.160
I've always thought you're really talented.

246
20:56.359 --> 20:58.359
Keep making good films in the future.

247
20:59.960 --> 21:00.960
Just make the kind

248
21:02.400 --> 21:03.240
that's real,

249
21:04.039 --> 21:05.119
that moves people,

250
21:05.680 --> 21:07.880
the kind that gives people strength.

251
21:08.000 --> 21:08.759
You know what I mean?

252
21:10.079 --> 21:11.599
Who even watches that stuff anymore?

253
21:14.240 --> 21:15.200
I'm thinking of

254
21:16.440 --> 21:17.000
getting laid off.

255
21:22.279 --> 21:23.359
Get outta here!

256
21:24.200 --> 21:25.400
If you get laid off,

257
21:26.440 --> 21:27.599
I don't even deserve to live.

258
21:29.640 --> 21:30.920
Just messing with you.

259
21:31.680 --> 21:32.880
I'll keep filming.

260
21:39.799 --> 21:41.400
Your hands are pretty rough, huh?

261
21:43.039 --> 21:44.400
The hands that hold a camera

262
21:45.400 --> 21:47.559
aren't any better than mine that rub feet.

263
22:05.079 --> 22:07.319
Take good care of yourself, okay?

264
22:10.680 --> 22:11.960
You take care too.

265
22:17.559 --> 22:18.119
Goodbye.

266
22:25.559 --> 22:26.640
By the way, Shen Leshui.

267
22:27.559 --> 22:28.240
Well...

268
22:28.720 --> 22:30.200
Cheng Youtian had someone

269
22:30.599 --> 22:32.519
give me the keys to Old Workers' Haven.

270
22:33.200 --> 22:34.359
He asked me to go by when I have time

271
22:34.359 --> 22:35.599
and help clean the place up.

272
22:36.160 --> 22:37.200
Why don't the two of us go together?

273
22:39.319 --> 22:40.839
If it weren't for Director Cheng that day,

274
22:41.559 --> 22:42.519
I'd be dead.

275
22:46.240 --> 22:48.359
How about noon the day after tomorrow?

276
22:49.039 --> 22:50.039
The day after tomorrow?

277
22:51.279 --> 22:52.319
Can't we do today?

278
22:53.960 --> 22:54.599
Let's make it the day after tomorrow.

279
22:55.319 --> 22:56.359
All right. What time then?

280
22:58.000 --> 22:58.720
11:30.

281
22:59.000 --> 22:59.519
Okay.

282
23:00.319 --> 23:01.599
See you at Old Workers' Haven.

283
23:09.559 --> 23:10.039
Bye.

284
23:12.960 --> 23:13.440
Bye.

285
23:30.640 --> 23:32.240
What is all this junk?

286
23:32.240 --> 23:32.680
Looks like

287
23:32.960 --> 23:34.039
a junk collector's dump.

288
23:35.319 --> 23:36.119
The place is sold.

289
23:36.119 --> 23:37.599
They're coming to renovate in a couple of days.

290
23:38.279 --> 23:39.759
I brought you some things

291
23:39.759 --> 23:41.240
so you don't call me wasteful.

292
23:41.960 --> 23:42.880
I can't stand it.

293
23:53.599 --> 23:54.720
You're all grown up now.

294
23:56.559 --> 23:57.640
So what are you going to do now?

295
23:59.079 --> 24:01.039
You've got hands, feet, and a brain.

296
24:01.039 --> 24:02.200
A whole bright future ahead.

297
24:04.200 --> 24:05.319
You're wheezing so hard.

298
24:06.079 --> 24:06.599
I'm fine.

299
24:06.599 --> 24:07.480
Let me listen. Let me listen.

300
24:14.519 --> 24:15.599
Your heartbeat...

301
24:15.599 --> 24:16.839
It's beating so strongly.

302
24:17.559 --> 24:18.400
It sounds wonderful.

303
24:20.759 --> 24:21.640
Of course.

304
24:24.640 --> 24:26.039
Getting in the right mindset

305
24:26.720 --> 24:27.759
was so crucial.

306
24:29.039 --> 24:30.920
We did the right thing.

307
24:33.559 --> 24:35.240
In this warm heartbeat,

308
24:35.880 --> 24:37.599
I feel like I can hear your voice.

309
24:38.640 --> 24:40.480
Thank you, Sister Xuemei.

310
24:41.960 --> 24:42.799
Your wish...

311
24:43.480 --> 24:44.759
I'll fulfill it for you.

312
24:50.759 --> 24:51.279
Give it to me.

313
24:51.480 --> 24:52.039
Thanks.

314
24:55.880 --> 24:57.200
Got all your things?

315
24:58.160 --> 24:59.160
Keep your ID safe.

316
25:01.839 --> 25:02.319
Once you

317
25:02.759 --> 25:03.720
head off to big Beijing,

318
25:04.079 --> 25:06.440
visit our little Lacheng when you're free.

319
25:07.599 --> 25:08.960
Come hang out with me on your vacation!

320
25:09.200 --> 25:10.240
How would I dare go there?

321
25:10.480 --> 25:11.079
Beijing is so huge.

322
25:11.079 --> 25:11.880
What if I get lost?

323
25:14.680 --> 25:16.039
What's with you?

324
25:16.480 --> 25:17.759
Why are you acting so shy?

325
25:18.359 --> 25:19.480
You're both single,

326
25:19.480 --> 25:20.559
and you were middle school deskmates.

327
25:20.559 --> 25:21.680
What's there to be shy about?

328
25:21.839 --> 25:22.599
Cut the nonsense.

329
25:23.920 --> 25:24.640
The two of us

330
25:25.440 --> 25:26.200
weren't deskmates.

331
25:26.200 --> 25:27.000
Front and back row.

332
25:27.519 --> 25:28.480
Xiao Gao isn't talking nonsense.

333
25:28.759 --> 25:29.599
You're just taking it the wrong way.

334
25:30.799 --> 25:31.839
Did I take it the wrong way?

335
25:32.440 --> 25:32.920
Look at you...

336
25:34.079 --> 25:34.680
Director Shen.

337
25:34.680 --> 25:36.279
Wait, Chief Editor Shen.

338
25:36.359 --> 25:37.160
Reporter Shen.

339
25:37.960 --> 25:39.119
Why do you have so many titles?

340
25:40.079 --> 25:40.920
What do you actually do?

341
25:41.279 --> 25:42.039
You have no fixed address,

342
25:42.039 --> 25:42.880
and so many titles.

343
25:43.200 --> 25:44.200
You could easily become

344
25:44.200 --> 25:45.640
a person of interest for us.

345
25:46.440 --> 25:47.960
Got a place to stay back in Beijing?

346
25:48.920 --> 25:50.440
Beijing is so expensive,

347
25:50.640 --> 25:51.720
and so crowded.

348
25:52.119 --> 25:53.000
At your age,

349
25:53.000 --> 25:53.839
would anyone even want you?

350
25:55.440 --> 25:56.319
What did you say?

351
25:57.079 --> 25:58.759
Nobody wants you!

352
25:59.480 --> 26:00.640
Look at all your wrinkles.

353
26:00.640 --> 26:01.480
You even have gray hair.

354
26:01.640 --> 26:02.240
Impossible.

355
26:02.359 --> 26:03.720
He just plucked them for me yesterday.

356
26:04.839 --> 26:05.759
You're supposed to pluck the gray ones, man!

357
26:06.799 --> 26:07.920
You didn't say to pluck the gray ones!

358
26:08.079 --> 26:09.200
So you plucked the black ones?!

359
26:09.839 --> 26:10.839
All right, cut it out.

360
26:13.680 --> 26:15.000
Look at you, all grown up,

361
26:15.359 --> 26:16.519
and you can't even spit it out.

362
26:16.640 --> 26:17.319
I'll say it for you.

363
26:20.240 --> 26:21.079
Classmate Shen Leshui,

364
26:22.440 --> 26:23.279
From the first time I saw you,

365
26:23.279 --> 26:23.960
I liked you.

366
26:24.640 --> 26:25.559
Through all three years of middle school,

367
26:25.559 --> 26:26.759
I always stared at your back.

368
26:27.440 --> 26:28.640
Now at our age,

369
26:28.960 --> 26:29.960
you're unmarried and so am I.

370
26:30.400 --> 26:32.039
Could we maybe just slip up

371
26:32.039 --> 26:32.839
and grow old together?

372
26:32.839 --> 26:33.759
Could... could you...

373
26:33.759 --> 26:34.960
Give me a break!

374
26:35.359 --> 26:36.079
What are you doing?

375
26:36.599 --> 26:38.319
D-Don't listen to his nonsense!

376
26:39.200 --> 26:40.319
It's fine, really.

377
26:40.599 --> 26:41.799
I don't feel that way either.

378
26:43.960 --> 26:44.599
You, though...

379
26:44.920 --> 26:46.000
take good care of yourself.

380
26:46.279 --> 26:47.200
Stay safe.

381
26:48.000 --> 26:49.240
Text me when you're free.

382
26:49.440 --> 26:50.079
Keep in touch.

383
26:51.000 --> 26:51.960
Sure, don't worry.

384
26:52.559 --> 26:53.480
If I text you,

385
26:53.920 --> 26:54.640
make sure to reply!

386
27:00.359 --> 27:01.039
Take care.

387
27:01.240 --> 27:01.839
Sister Leshui,

388
27:02.559 --> 27:03.680
sorry for all the trouble.

389
27:04.640 --> 27:05.200
Thank you.

390
27:07.599 --> 27:08.759
Say hello to Grandma for me.

391
27:13.000 --> 27:14.279
Keep up your in-depth reporting.

392
27:14.799 --> 27:15.880
Do a poor job, and I'll disown you.

393
27:17.039 --> 27:17.920
You do your best, too.

394
27:18.279 --> 27:19.559
Do a poor job, and I'll disown you too.

395
27:21.400 --> 27:22.039
Safe travels.

396
27:24.160 --> 27:24.720
Take care.

397
27:30.880 --> 27:31.599
Did you freeze up?

398
27:36.440 --> 27:36.880
Come here.

399
27:37.920 --> 27:38.680
Student Han Chuang.

400
27:39.599 --> 27:40.200
What?

401
27:40.720 --> 27:41.359
Officer Han.

402
27:41.880 --> 27:42.480
Keep it up.

403
27:42.799 --> 27:45.680
W-Wait, why do I get treated differently?

404
27:50.559 --> 27:51.759
You take care of yourself too.

405
27:52.480 --> 27:53.960
Look after yourself back in Beijing.

406
27:54.839 --> 27:56.079
If there's ever anything...

407
27:56.079 --> 27:56.960
...troubling you... The car's here.

408
27:58.519 --> 27:59.200
I'm freezing.

409
27:59.480 --> 28:00.000
Take care.

410
28:01.200 --> 28:01.720
I'm off.

411
28:02.480 --> 28:03.000
Take care.

412
28:03.240 --> 28:03.720
Take care.

413
28:04.599 --> 28:05.200
Take care.

414
28:05.720 --> 28:06.240
Take care.

415
28:06.720 --> 28:07.200
I'm off.

416
28:31.079 --> 28:31.759
Come on!

417
29:17.000 --> 29:17.680
Alright.

418
29:18.319 --> 29:19.240
Quite the fortune cat, huh?

419
29:20.799 --> 29:22.079
This classmate of mine...

420
29:22.279 --> 29:23.079
has really had it rough.

421
29:30.640 --> 29:31.519
We've still got a job to do.

422
29:31.880 --> 29:32.359
Let's go.

423
29:53.119 --> 29:53.720
Hello.

424
29:54.720 --> 29:56.079
Is this Old Workers' Haven?

425
29:56.279 --> 29:56.680
Yeah.

426
29:58.720 --> 30:00.759
Shen Leshui told me to be here at 11:30 AM

427
30:01.279 --> 30:03.319
to look for a Ms. Tu Chunyan.

428
30:04.880 --> 30:06.039
I'm Tu Chunyan.

429
30:07.680 --> 30:09.400
Shen Leshui also asked me

430
30:09.400 --> 30:10.200
to meet her here at this time.

431
30:10.480 --> 30:11.160
Where is she?

432
30:11.480 --> 30:12.839
I have no idea where she went either.

433
30:15.240 --> 30:16.599
This Shen Leshui...

434
30:16.759 --> 30:17.519
She set up a meeting and didn't even show up.

435
30:17.519 --> 30:18.960
What's she pulling here?

436
30:20.400 --> 30:21.039
Who are you, anyway?

437
30:21.640 --> 30:22.559
I'm Liu Xiaosheng.

438
30:23.000 --> 30:24.240
Liu Xuemei's son.

439
30:37.680 --> 30:38.880
It's from Shen Leshui.

440
30:48.519 --> 30:49.720
Chun... Chun...

441
30:49.720 --> 30:50.279
Sister Chunyan...

442
30:51.359 --> 30:52.559
My mom is innocent.

443
30:54.559 --> 30:55.279
Is it here? I...

444
30:55.440 --> 30:55.759
I...

445
30:57.960 --> 30:58.720
My mom...

446
30:59.880 --> 31:01.039
My mom is innocent.

447
31:04.039 --> 31:04.839
She's innocent.

448
31:15.839 --> 31:16.359
Whoa.

449
31:40.400 --> 31:41.359
What's this supposed to mean?

450
31:41.759 --> 31:43.039
Where did all this money come from?

451
31:43.240 --> 31:44.000
My mom's bag.

452
31:49.359 --> 31:50.519
This is Shen Leshui's money.

453
31:51.000 --> 31:51.640
Exactly 200,000.

454
31:51.960 --> 31:53.880
She asked me to make sure it gets to both of you.

455
31:55.680 --> 31:56.279
Here's the receipt.

456
32:00.839 --> 32:02.039
This is Shen Leshui's

457
32:02.640 --> 32:03.599
money from selling her house.

458
32:06.880 --> 32:07.880
Please sign for it.

459
32:10.559 --> 32:11.880
Here, Xiaosheng.

460
32:37.200 --> 32:37.720
Bro,

461
32:44.359 --> 32:45.519
where did Shen Leshui go?

462
32:47.640 --> 32:48.480
She went back to Beijing.

463
33:12.920 --> 33:14.119
Dear Xiaosheng,

464
33:15.000 --> 33:15.640
Chunyan,

465
33:16.680 --> 33:17.720
it's Shen Leshui.

466
33:18.559 --> 33:20.279
I had to leave early this morning,

467
33:20.839 --> 33:21.960
so I am counting on you both.

468
33:22.799 --> 33:24.000
Please help me

469
33:24.000 --> 33:25.000
read this letter to everyone.

470
33:26.519 --> 33:27.599
All this time,

471
33:28.480 --> 33:29.640
I've been trying to find out

472
33:29.640 --> 33:31.279
what happened to Liu Xuemei's money.

473
33:31.960 --> 33:34.720
Now, there is finally conclusive proof.

474
33:35.079 --> 33:35.759
Therefore,

475
33:36.160 --> 33:37.440
I can state with certainty that

476
33:39.160 --> 33:40.359
Liu Xuemei was innocent.

477
33:44.680 --> 33:45.920
Over a decade ago,

478
33:46.440 --> 33:47.240
Liu Xuemei

479
33:47.279 --> 33:50.039
was blocked outside the auction by Ma Guowen,

480
33:50.880 --> 33:51.839
deliberately forced to drink,

481
33:52.279 --> 33:53.720
and died of hypothermia.

482
33:55.240 --> 33:56.559
With her very life,

483
33:57.240 --> 33:59.559
she recovered the money that belonged to the fellow workers.

484
34:01.400 --> 34:02.599
Regrettably,

485
34:03.400 --> 34:04.720
the truth

486
34:04.880 --> 34:06.799
only came to light

487
34:06.799 --> 34:08.000
more than a decade after her death.

488
34:09.039 --> 34:09.960
This 200,000 yuan...

489
34:10.719 --> 34:12.800
Liu Xuemei originally wanted to give it to those

490
34:13.039 --> 34:14.440
who pooled funds to buy the factory,

491
34:14.800 --> 34:17.239
yet were afraid to step forward to reclaim it,

492
34:18.480 --> 34:19.440
as well as

493
34:19.719 --> 34:20.679
those fellow workers facing hardships

494
34:20.880 --> 34:22.559
and in need of help.

495
34:24.280 --> 34:26.000
I've asked Officer Gao Xuelin

496
34:26.000 --> 34:27.360
to deliver this long-overdue gesture

497
34:27.599 --> 34:28.599
to all of you.

498
34:31.639 --> 34:33.400
Please handle these funds

499
34:33.840 --> 34:35.159
according to Liu Xuemei's wishes,

500
34:36.800 --> 34:39.440
and pass on her kindness and sincerity

501
34:39.840 --> 34:41.199
to everyone.

502
34:46.519 --> 34:48.880
She was a noble woman,

503
34:50.679 --> 34:52.360
a decent soul full of love and integrity,

504
34:54.719 --> 34:56.320
and a friend worthy of being remembered.

505
34:58.119 --> 34:58.760
In addition,

506
34:59.480 --> 35:00.719
I want to pay tribute to every fellow worker

507
35:00.719 --> 35:02.920
who took part in the factory buyout back then,

508
35:03.639 --> 35:05.440
as well as all the fellow workers

509
35:05.440 --> 35:07.599
who were laid off in Ma Guowen's retaliation.

510
35:07.880 --> 35:08.519
I salute you all.

511
35:15.280 --> 35:16.440
Your kindness,

512
35:17.119 --> 35:17.840
optimism,

513
35:18.440 --> 35:19.599
and love for life

514
35:20.800 --> 35:23.400
meant that in your hardest, most painful,

515
35:23.559 --> 35:24.840
and loneliest times,

516
35:25.320 --> 35:27.239
you never forgot to strive hard

517
35:27.639 --> 35:28.599
and help one another.

518
35:29.639 --> 35:30.440
I am deeply sorry

519
35:31.159 --> 35:32.880
that back then, I failed to publish

520
35:32.880 --> 35:35.199
the truth about your struggle.

521
35:35.639 --> 35:37.920
I ask for your forgiveness here and now.

522
35:40.239 --> 35:41.639
I also want to tell you:

523
35:42.039 --> 35:43.119
what happened in the past

524
35:43.639 --> 35:45.039
is now history.

525
35:45.679 --> 35:47.800
Always remember those days of fighting together.

526
35:48.639 --> 35:50.880
A brighter tomorrow surely awaits us.

527
35:56.599 --> 35:57.360
Th-This... This...

528
35:59.280 --> 36:00.480
This is the 200,000 yuan!

529
36:06.960 --> 36:08.079
Liu Xuemei was innocent!

530
36:09.960 --> 36:10.639
Xiaosheng,

531
36:11.519 --> 36:12.639
your mother was innocent!

532
36:15.000 --> 36:16.239
My mother was innocent!

533
36:18.079 --> 36:19.239
She was a good person!

534
36:21.039 --> 36:22.559
She never betrayed your trust!

535
37:30.840 --> 37:31.639
Sister Xuemei,

536
37:32.599 --> 37:33.719
I really can't think of

537
37:33.840 --> 37:35.760
a better way to honor your memory,

538
37:36.679 --> 37:37.679
so let's all

539
37:38.519 --> 37:39.760
drink till we drop with you.

540
38:02.039 --> 38:02.920
Hello, everyone.

541
38:03.159 --> 38:04.760
My name is Sun Jianguo.

542
38:04.880 --> 38:06.440
I'm 40 this year.

543
38:06.800 --> 38:08.159
I've been working at this factory

544
38:08.159 --> 38:10.199
for 22 years now.

545
38:10.760 --> 38:12.840
I've been very happy here.

546
38:13.199 --> 38:15.199
Every day feels fulfilling.

547
38:15.679 --> 38:16.719
My name is Li Dongyuan.

548
38:16.960 --> 38:18.400
I'm 32 years old.

549
38:18.880 --> 38:20.719
I have a three-year-old son.

550
38:21.000 --> 38:22.239
I work here.

551
38:22.599 --> 38:24.000
I love Lacheng Brewery.

552
38:24.000 --> 38:25.360
Lacheng Brewery is my home.

553
38:25.760 --> 38:27.159
My name is Ge Shun.

554
38:27.239 --> 38:28.559
I'm 35 years old.

555
38:28.800 --> 38:29.960
At Lacheng Brewery,

556
38:29.960 --> 38:31.960
I've worked for 15 years.

557
38:32.400 --> 38:33.320
Working here,

558
38:33.320 --> 38:35.039
I feel honored and proud.

559
38:35.760 --> 38:37.559
As for my dream,

560
38:37.760 --> 38:39.519
work hard, make more money,

561
38:39.800 --> 38:41.280
so my wife and son

562
38:41.400 --> 38:43.079
can live a good life.

563
38:43.480 --> 38:44.159
Next up,

564
39:06.199 --> 39:07.280
At the end of 1999,

565
39:07.960 --> 39:09.639
the auction of Lacheng Brewery

566
39:10.000 --> 39:12.519
was a turning point for many fellow workers.

567
39:13.599 --> 39:15.440
It held both passion and struggle,

568
39:15.960 --> 39:17.519
as well as silence and betrayal.

569
39:18.840 --> 39:19.800
Regrettably,

570
39:20.440 --> 39:22.559
the documentary The Malt Kingdom back then,

571
39:22.800 --> 39:24.239
under pressure from various sides,

572
39:24.760 --> 39:27.079
failed to capture the full picture of the event.

573
39:28.599 --> 39:30.239
The intention behind The New Malt Kingdom

574
39:30.960 --> 39:33.320
is to offer the fellow workers caught in it

575
39:33.960 --> 39:37.519
a belated tribute and apology.

576
39:38.280 --> 39:39.599
Here, there's not only

577
39:39.599 --> 39:41.039
the journey of their past struggles,

578
39:41.559 --> 39:43.519
but also their unyielding resistance.

579
39:44.920 --> 39:45.880
The New Malt Kingdom

580
39:46.199 --> 39:48.519
will present the whole story from start to finish.

581
39:49.400 --> 39:52.079
Their stories deserve to be seen.

582
39:52.920 --> 39:53.960
Their lives

583
39:54.880 --> 39:56.039
deserve to be recorded.

584
39:57.119 --> 39:58.159
Some say

585
39:58.519 --> 39:59.920
under the shadow of the internet,

586
40:00.599 --> 40:02.280
the line between truth and falsehood

587
40:02.559 --> 40:03.800
grows harder and harder to discern.

588
40:04.880 --> 40:07.760
Traditional media will inevitably be left behind,

589
40:08.400 --> 40:09.719
and news that reflects the facts

590
40:10.000 --> 40:11.320
will ultimately be replaced

591
40:11.320 --> 40:13.400
by one sensational headline after another.

592
40:14.920 --> 40:16.239
But as a journalist,

593
40:16.800 --> 40:17.800
what I want to record

594
40:18.480 --> 40:20.199
are real people

595
40:20.639 --> 40:21.639
and real events.

596
40:23.440 --> 40:26.480
The truth is often fragmented and complex,

597
40:27.119 --> 40:29.119
accompanied by discordant noise.

598
40:30.159 --> 40:31.400
Yet precisely because of this,

599
40:32.280 --> 40:34.719
the laughter and tears

600
40:35.280 --> 40:36.519
become all the more precious.

601
40:38.079 --> 40:39.159
Even today,

602
40:40.000 --> 40:41.159
I still remember

603
40:41.639 --> 40:42.840
those youthful,

604
40:42.840 --> 40:44.480
vibrant faces I saw back then,

605
40:45.119 --> 40:47.119
and those spirited vows.

606
40:48.679 --> 40:50.199
Though times have changed,

607
40:51.079 --> 40:52.639
and many who lived through it

608
40:53.000 --> 40:54.599
have gone from their prime

609
40:55.079 --> 40:56.519
to silver-haired elders,

610
40:57.719 --> 40:58.840
while some

611
40:59.599 --> 41:00.920
have already passed away,

612
41:01.800 --> 41:03.360
I hope these memories

613
41:04.079 --> 41:06.199
will become part of history,

614
41:07.280 --> 41:08.840
remembered forever.

615
41:09.800 --> 41:11.280
Time is a cure,

616
41:11.639 --> 41:12.840
and also a cup of mellow wine.

617
41:13.599 --> 41:15.079
Tempered through the years,

618
41:15.679 --> 41:16.840
its fragrance only deepens.

619
41:18.159 --> 41:20.199
Let us open the gates of the Malt Kingdom,

620
41:20.880 --> 41:22.719
and in this golden land,

621
41:23.119 --> 41:24.199
dream together

622
41:24.599 --> 41:26.480
a grand, beer-scented dream.

623
41:28.519 --> 41:29.800
These final words,

624
41:30.639 --> 41:31.639
I write to myself:

625
41:33.559 --> 41:34.320
Shen Leshui,

626
41:35.760 --> 41:37.199
ever since you graduated from college,

627
41:37.480 --> 41:38.960
you wanted to be a journalist,

628
41:39.840 --> 41:40.920
to report the truth,

629
41:41.360 --> 41:42.440
care about life,

630
41:43.360 --> 41:45.480
and record ordinary people's joys and sorrows.

631
41:47.000 --> 41:48.599
Though there were wasted years and regrets,

632
41:49.039 --> 41:49.800
I still hope

633
41:50.039 --> 41:52.239
you'll never forget your ideals.

634
41:52.960 --> 41:55.599
Don't let life smooth away your edges.

635
41:56.280 --> 41:59.239
Don't let the years halt your steps.

636
42:00.199 --> 42:01.760
When you grow old

637
42:02.360 --> 42:04.159
and look back on your life,

638
42:04.920 --> 42:06.360
may you proudly say:

639
42:07.320 --> 42:08.119
"I was here."

640
42:09.920 --> 42:10.519
Hello,

641
42:11.280 --> 42:12.159
Shen Leshui.

642
42:13.320 --> 42:14.199
Hello.
